    "body": "Advances the authorization/privacy audit by hardening the authenticated wallet read boundary.\n\nChanges:\n- reject missing or transient authenticated principals before wallet balance/history services are invoked\n- preserve actor-scoped wallet access and avoid null-principal 500s leaking implementation behavior\n- add a regression test proving both wallet endpoints perform zero financial-service interactions without a persistent user identity\n\nRoadmap: advances #615/#618/#620 and umbrella #957 authorization/privacy/IDOR audit.\n\nSecurity intent: fail closed before any financial state access.",
